content:
The ordering row and product text tie all three bit rates to both OM3 (70 m) and OM4 (100 m) reach; rate select (RS0/RS1) distinguishes bit rate, fiber type distinguishes reach. Six modes cover every supported (rate, reach) pair without inventing pairings.

